        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result of these efforts, in 2021 we developed a range of low embodied CO2 cement and ready-mix products under the global brand Vertua, including Vertua Lower Carbon, a range of products in our portfolio that have a lower embodied CO2 compared to a corresponding reference.",
